  "body": "## Improvements\r\n\r\n- Update background task records to omit original args and kwargs at creation, reducing unnecessary parameter persistence\r\n- Strengthen persistent write protection for databases and Redis in high availability deployments across container restarts, recreation, and failure recovery\r\n- Improve redeployment completion checks to tolerate normal replication lag, and refine switchover waits and recovery coordination to reduce false failure detection\r\n\r\n## Bug Fixes\r\n\r\n- Validate Access Token format while preserving fallback compatibility with other Bearer Token authentication methods\r\n- Fix NLA configuration and RDP service refresh during Tinker applet host deployment, checking Group Policy and disabling listener NLA before installation, then verifying the configuration afterward; stop deployment with clear guidance when Group Policy requires NLA\r\n- Fix race conditions involving role callbacks, operation locks, and file synchronization acknowledgments during switchover, automatic rejoin, and startup recovery [JumpServer EE]\r\n- Improve MySQL/MariaDB replication position handling and crash recovery, and fix a race condition in PostgreSQL replication slot cleanup during standby rebuilds [JumpServer EE]\r\n- Fix local administrator credential recovery and health checks during MySQL/MariaDB maintenance, avoiding the use of peer credentials or stale application passwords [JumpServer EE]",
